  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribution on technical advice and capacity building on public financial management, macroeconomic and debt sustainability</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Demand-led, short-term technical assistance and capacity building to governments in the ODA eligible Caribbean countries (Belize, Dominica, Grenada, Guyana, Jamaica, Saint Lucia, and Saint Vincent and the Grenadines) for core economic policy making to improve macroeconomic sustainability. Delivery of technical assistance on strengthening macroeconomic policy, debt management and climate finance, Public Financial Management (PFM), tax and customs administration, financial sector surveillance, regulation and supervision, anti-money laundering, and statistics.</narrative>
  </description>
